            "subject": "Help with JWT refresh tokens?",
            "body_text": "Hi Alex,\n\nI'm working on the user session management feature and running into an issue with the JWT refresh token flow. When a user's access token expires, I'm not sure if I should:\n\na) Automatically refresh on any 401 response\nb) Only refresh on specific endpoints\nc) Let the frontend handle the refresh logic\n\nI've read through a few articles but they all seem to recommend different approaches. Given our architecture, what would you suggest?\n\nI know you've implemented this before at your previous company, so I thought I'd ask. Happy to jump on a quick call if that's easier.\n\nThanks!\nDavid",
            "priority": "normal",
            "labels": [
              "work"
            ],
